Insurance Policy Management System
1. Project Details
Project Title
Insurance Policy Management System – REST API using Spring Boot and MongoDB
Project Description
The Insurance Policy Management System is a backend-only application developed to manage insurance operations digitally. The system provides RESTful APIs for managing Customers, Policies, Agents, Claims, and Premium Payments. It supports complete CRUD operations and implements real-world insurance workflows such as policy purchase, agent assignment, premium payment processing, claim filing and approval, and policy renewal.
The project demonstrates MongoDB relationship modeling using embedded documents and references to represent One-to-One, One-to-Many, Many-to-One, and Many-to-Many relationships. All APIs are documented using Swagger/OpenAPI and tested through Postman.
