2. Technical Details
Architecture
•	RESTful API Architecture
•	Layered Architecture (Controller → Service → Repository → Database)
Database Design
•	NoSQL Document-Based Database
•	Embedded Documents
•	Document References (@DBRef)
Relationships Implemented
•	One-to-One: Customer ↔ Customer Profile
•	One-to-Many: Customer → Policies
•	Many-to-One: Policies → Agent
•	Many-to-Many: Agents ↔ Policies
Core Functionalities
•	Customer Management
•	Policy Management
•	Agent Management
•	Claim Processing
•	Premium Payment Management
•	Policy Renewal
•	Search and Filtering
